~~~/DESIGN_AGENT_PROMPT.md
# Fey Design System - Agent Prompt

Use this prompt when creating new components, pages, or applications that need to follow the Fey brand guidelines.

---

## Design Agent Instructions

You are building a UI component/page/application that follows the **Fey Design System** - a high-end fintech aesthetic characterized by dark, immersive, precision-engineered interfaces.

### Core Aesthetic Principles

**Design Philosophy**: Create interfaces that convey trust, intelligence, and modernity through:
- Deep, immersive dark backgrounds
- Glassmorphism effects for depth and layering
- Refined, high-contrast typography
- Minimal, purposeful interactions
- Content-first layouts with generous spacing

**Tone**: Professional, sophisticated, modern, trustworthy. Avoid playful or casual design elements.

---

## Required Design Specifications

### 1. Color Palette (STRICT)

**Backgrounds:**
- Primary: `#0b0b0f` (Deep Navy/Black) - Use as main canvas background
- Pure Black: `#000000` - Use in gradients, masks, and for maximum depth
- Glass Surfaces: `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` - Cards, buttons, and floating elements

**Typography Colors:**
- Primary Text: `#e6e6e6` (Off-White) - High contrast, maximum readability
- Secondary Text: `rgba(255,255,255,0.5)` - Subtle headings, de-emphasized content
- Muted Text: `#868f97` - Footer text, metadata, timestamps
- Ghost Text: `rgba(255,255,255,0.047)` - Large decorative text with shadow effects

**Accent Colors:**
- Brand Blue: `#479ffa` - Primary actions, links, active states, focus indicators
- Highlight Orange: `#ffa16c` - Secondary accents, labels, highlights

**CRITICAL**: Never use colors outside this palette. All UI elements must use these exact values.

---

### 2. Typography System (MANDATORY)

**Font Stack**: 
```css
font-family: calibre, "calibre_Fallback", system-ui, sans-serif;
```

**Type Scale:**

| Purpose | Size | Weight | Line Height | Additional Styles |
|---------|------|--------|-------------|-------------------|
| Display Hero | 54px | 600 (Semibold) | 1.1 | text-shadow: 0px 4px 24px #000 |
| Section Heading | 26px | 600 (Semibold) | 26px | opacity: 0.5 |
| Lead Paragraph | 24px | 600 (Semibold) | 31.2px | - |
| Section Label | 18px | 400 (Regular) | 23.4px | - |
| Body Default | 16px | 400 (Regular) | 1.4 | - |
| Nav/Small | 14px | 400 (Regular) | 1.4 | - |

**Usage Rules:**
- Hero titles should have text shadow for depth
- Section headings use 50% opacity for subtle hierarchy
- All text must be antialiased: `antialiased` class
- Use high contrast (`#e6e6e6`) for body text against dark backgrounds

---

### 3. Layout & Spacing Standards

**Container System:**
- Max Width: `max-w-[1220px]` centered with `mx-auto`
- Horizontal Padding: `px-10` (40px left/right)

**Vertical Rhythm:**
- Section Spacing: `py-32` (128px top/bottom)
- Alternative spacing: `pt-[87px]` top, `pb-[70px]` bottom
- Component gaps: `gap-y-[34px] gap-x-[34px]` for grid/flex layouts

**Layout Patterns:**
- Use Flexbox or CSS Grid for component alignment
- Prefer asymmetric, content-driven layouts over rigid grids
- Give content breathing room - generous whitespace is essential

---

### 4. UI Components & Patterns

#### Buttons & Pills

**Style**: Glassmorphism with pill shapes

```css
/* Primary Button/Pill Style */
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
border-radius: 99px; /* Full pill */
backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

/* Hover State */
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
```

**Variants:**
- Full Pill: `rounded-[99px]`
- Organic Pill: `rounded-br-[99px] rounded-t-[99px] rounded-bl-[99px]`

**Interaction:**
- Default: `opacity-80`
- Hover: `opacity-100` + background lightens to `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)`
- Active/Selected: Use Brand Blue `#479ffa` as background or border

#### Cards & Containers

**Glass Card Style:**
```css
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
border-radius: 16px; /* or as needed */
padding: 24px; /* adjust based on content */
```

**Shadows for Elevation:**
- Floating elements: `shadow-[rgba(0,0,0,0.12)_0px_30.0444px_16.2444px_0px]`

#### Navigation

**Style Requirements:**
- Position: `fixed` or `absolute` with `z-index: 100`
- Structure: Flexbox with `justify-between`
- Background: Glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur-[10px]`, semi-transparent)
- Items: Text links or icon buttons
- Active state: Brand Blue `#479ffa`

#### Icons

**Style:**
- Minimalist, thin stroke: `stroke-width: 1.5px`
- Color: White `#e6e6e6` or Brand Blue `#479ffa`
- Default state: `opacity-50`
- Hover state: `opacity-100`

**Recommended Icon Library**: `lucide-react` (thin, modern icons match the aesthetic)

---

### 5. Visual Effects (Apply Consistently)

#### Glassmorphism
```css
backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
```
Use for: Buttons, cards, navigation bars, modals, overlays

#### Text Shadows
```css
text-shadow: 0px 4px 24px rgb(0,0,0);
```
Use for: Hero titles, large display text

#### Mask Gradients (for fade-outs)
```css
mask-image: linear-gradient(160deg, rgb(0,0,0) 120%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 200%);
```
Use for: Content overflow, section transitions

#### Focus States
```css
/* Custom caret color */
caret-color: #479ffa;

/* Text selection */
::selection {
  background: #479ffa;
  color: white;
}
```

---

### 6. Animation & Interaction Guidelines

**Principles:**
- Subtle, smooth transitions (200-300ms)
- Use opacity shifts for hover states
- Avoid jarring or playful animations
- Prefer CSS transitions over JavaScript when possible

**Common Patterns:**
- Hover: Opacity `0.8` → `1.0`, background lightens
- Focus: Add ring with Brand Blue `#479ffa`
- Loading states: Subtle pulse or fade

**Suggested Library**: `framer-motion` for React animations

---

### 7. Accessibility Requirements

- **Contrast**: All text must meet WCAG AA standards (already enforced by `#e6e6e6` on `#0b0b0f`)
- **Focus Indicators**: Always visible, use Brand Blue `#479ffa` ring
- **Keyboard Navigation**: All interactive elements must be keyboard accessible
- **Screen Readers**: Proper semantic HTML and ARIA labels

---

### 8. Implementation Checklist

Before considering your component complete, verify:

**Colors:**
- [ ] Background is `#0b0b0f`
- [ ] Primary text is `#e6e6e6`
- [ ] Accent colors are `#479ffa` (blue) or `#ffa16c` (orange) only
- [ ] No colors outside the approved palette

**Typography:**
- [ ] Font family is `calibre, system-ui, sans-serif`
- [ ] Type sizes match the scale (54px hero, 26px headings, 16px body)
- [ ] Text is antialiased
- [ ] Line heights follow specifications

**Layout:**
- [ ] Container is `max-w-[1220px]` centered
- [ ] Horizontal padding is `px-10`
- [ ] Vertical section spacing is `py-32` or equivalent
- [ ] Content has generous whitespace

**Components:**
- [ ] Buttons use glassmorphism with `rounded-[99px]`
- [ ] Cards use `backdrop-blur-[10px]`
- [ ] Icons are thin stroke (`1.5px`) and use approved colors
- [ ] Navigation is fixed/absolute with glass effect

**Effects:**
- [ ] Glassmorphism applied to floating elements
- [ ] Text shadows on hero/display text
- [ ] Smooth transitions on interactive elements
- [ ] Custom caret color (`#479ffa`)

**Accessibility:**
- [ ] Sufficient contrast for all text
- [ ] Focus states visible with Brand Blue ring
- [ ] Keyboard navigation functional
- [ ] Semantic HTML used throughout

---

## Example Code Patterns

### Hero Section
```jsx
<section className="relative min-h-screen bg-[#0b0b0f] flex items-center justify-center px-10">
  <div className="max-w-[1220px] mx-auto text-center">
