<button className="px-6 py-3 bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] hover:bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.12)] backdrop-blur-[10px] rounded-[99px] text-[#e6e6e6] font-medium transition-all duration-200">
  Call to Action
