# MaternityCareHome

A warm, nurturing maternity care mobile app home screen component designed for emotional support, self-care tracking, and helping mothers feel welcomed and understood.

## Features

- 🌸 Personalized greeting with time-based icons and motivational messages
- 💕 Mood check-in with 4 emotional states and validating responses
- ✨ Daily self-care progress tracker with beautiful gradient progress ring
- 📱 Content exploration cards with smooth animations
- 🎨 Soft, feminine design aesthetic with floating decorative elements
- 🔔 Bottom navigation with prominent center action button

## Dependencies

```json
{
  "react": "^18.2.0",
  "react-dom": "^18.2.0",
  "lucide-react": "^0.312.0",
  "framer-motion": "^11.0.0"
}
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `userName` | `string` | `"Maria"` | User's display name |
| `completedCares` | `number` | `2` | Number of completed care tasks |
| `totalCares` | `number` | `6` | Total care tasks for the day |
| `moods` | `MoodOption[]` | Default moods | Array of mood options |
| `exploreItems` | `ExploreItem[]` | Default items | Array of explore section items |
| `onMoodSelect` | `(moodId: string) => void` | - | Callback when mood is selected |
| `onCareCardClick` | `() => void` | - | Callback when care card is clicked |
| `onExploreClick` | `(itemId: string) => void` | - | Callback when explore item is clicked |
| `onNavClick` | `(tabId: string) => void` | - | Callback when nav item is clicked |

## Types

```typescript
interface MoodOption {
  id: string;
  label: string;
  color: string;
  bgGradient: string;
  icon: string;
  message: string;
}

interface ExploreItem {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  description: string;
  icon: React.ReactNode;
  gradient: string;
  shadowColor: string;
  isNew?: boolean;
}
```

