| `spotlightOpacity` | `number` | `1.0` | Intensity of the spotlight effect |
| `distortAmount` | `number` | `0` | Wave distortion amount |
| `shineDirection` | `'left' \| 'right'` | `'left'` | Direction of the blind highlight |
